answer:
According to IN 338/2024, the Equivalent Foreign Regulatory Authorities (AREEs) listed for the application of the optimized analysis procedure based on regulatory reliance practices are:

1. European Medicines Agency (EMA) and its member countries;
2. Health Canada (HC);
3. Swissmedic;
4. Medicines and Healthcare Products Regulatory Agency (MHRA) - United Kingdom;
5. US Food and Drug Administration (FDA);
6. Pharmaceuticals and Medical Devices Agency (PMDA) - Japan.

[IN 338/2024, Art. 5]

